WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:15.559
&gt;&gt; Laura: YOU JUST HEARD DINESH

00:00:14.258 --> 00:00:16.960
D'SOUZA TELL US ABOUT THE

00:00:15.693 --> 00:00:19.663
HORRORS OF THE OBAMA

00:00:17.094 --> 00:00:23.867
ADMINISTRATION, WHICH I ASKED

00:00:19.797 --> 00:00:27.304
MIKE ABOUT A SHORT WHILE AGO.

00:00:27.438 --> 00:00:30.441
DINESH D'SOUZA ABOUT THE HORRORS

00:00:28.906 --> 00:00:32.509
OF THE POLITICAL PROSECUTIONS,

00:00:30.574 --> 00:00:33.010
WHAT HE BELIEVES, BY THE OBAMA

00:00:32.643 --> 00:00:34.578
ADMINISTRATION.

00:00:33.143 --> 00:00:36.714
AND HIS EXPERIENCE CERTAINLY HAS

00:00:34.712 --> 00:00:37.848
SOME IMPLICATION, I THINK, FOR

00:00:36.847 --> 00:00:39.450
THE RUSSIA INVESTIGATION, AS WE

00:00:37.981 --> 00:00:42.119
MIGHT LOOK AT THIS UNHOLY

00:00:39.583 --> 00:00:43.520
ALLIANCE OF THE FBI DIRECTOR JIM

00:00:42.252 --> 00:00:45.022
COMEY AND DOJ PROSECUTORS.

00:00:43.654 --> 00:00:47.558
WHAT DO YOU THINK ABOUT, FOR

00:00:45.155 --> 00:00:48.592
LACK OF A BETTER TERM, THIS

00:00:47.691 --> 00:00:49.727
RUNAWAY PROSECUTION THAT A LOT

00:00:48.726 --> 00:00:51.729
OF US ARE CONCERNED ABOUT?

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:54.832
&gt;&gt; I THINK THAT IN THE NORMAL

00:00:51.862 --> 00:00:55.733
COURSE, THAT SORT OF CASE WOULD

00:00:54.965 --> 00:01:00.537
HAVE BEEN PROSECUTED WITH THE

00:00:55.866 --> 00:01:04.908
OUTCOME BEING A FINE.

00:01:00.671 --> 00:01:06.310
IT'S NOT ONE OF THE BRIGHTER

00:01:05.042 --> 00:01:07.444
CHAPTERS THAT HE PARTICIPATED IN

00:01:06.443 --> 00:01:07.878
PROSECUTING THIS IN THE WAY THAT

00:01:07.578 --> 00:01:09.847
HE DID.

00:01:08.011 --> 00:01:10.814
WE'VE HAD A COUPLE OF OTHER

00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:13.984
DINGS AND DENTS.

00:01:10.948 --> 00:01:14.852
BUT THAT WAS, I THINK, A PRETTY

00:01:14.118 --> 00:01:18.655
SUBSTANTIAL ONE.

00:01:14.985 --> 00:01:22.993
&gt;&gt; Laura: JUDGE MUKASEY, ADAM

00:01:18.789 --> 00:01:27.131
SCHIFF SAID THE PARDON OF DINESH

00:01:23.127 --> 00:01:28.365
D'SOUZA IS BASICALLY AN APPARENT

00:01:27.264 --> 00:01:29.767
SIGNAL BY THE PRESIDENT TO

00:01:28.499 --> 00:01:32.603
SIGNAL OTHERS, LOOK, IF YOU DO

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:32.903
RIGHT BY ME, I'LL DO RIGHT BY

00:01:32.736 --> 00:01:34.605
YOU.

00:01:33.036 --> 00:01:36.306
&gt;&gt; IT'S FURTHER EVIDENCE OF A

00:01:34.738 --> 00:01:37.141
CORRUPT INTENT ON THE

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:38.442
PRESIDENT'S PART.

00:01:37.274 --> 00:01:40.944
FURTHER EVIDENCE HE MAY HAVE

00:01:38.575 --> 00:01:42.913
VIOLATED THE LAW BY OBSTRUCTING

00:01:41.078 --> 00:01:44.248
JUSTICE, IN THE FIRING OF COMEY,

00:01:43.046 --> 00:01:46.417
BUT IN OTHER EFFORTS AS WELL.

00:01:44.381 --> 00:01:49.286
IT LOOKS A LOT LIKE A MESSAGE TO

00:01:46.550 --> 00:01:51.221
MICHAEL CULLEN WHO MAY ALSO BE

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:53.123
IMPLICATED IN EXCEEDING CAMPAIGN

00:01:51.355 --> 00:01:53.457
LIMITS WITH THAT STORMY DANIELS

00:01:53.257 --> 00:01:54.591
PAYMENT.

00:01:53.590 --> 00:01:55.526
YOU HAVE THE FURTHER

00:01:54.725 --> 00:01:57.528
ANNOUNCEMENT BY THE PRESIDENT

00:01:55.659 --> 00:01:59.630
THAT HE MAY PARDON MARTHA

00:01:57.661 --> 00:02:01.365
STUDENT, ANOTHER TV PERSONALITY

00:01:59.763 --> 00:02:02.933
WHO WAS CONVICTED OF, GUESS

00:02:01.498 --> 00:02:05.269
WHAT, OBSTRUCTION OF JUSTICE AND

00:02:03.066 --> 00:02:06.370
LYING TO AUTHORITIES.

00:02:05.402 --> 00:02:08.705
NOTHING ABOUT TRANSPARENT.

00:02:06.503 --> 00:02:10.974
&gt;&gt; THEY SAID THE SAME THING

00:02:08.839 --> 00:02:12.709
EVERY TIME HE EITHER ISSUES A

00:02:11.108 --> 00:02:15.679
PARDON OR MAKES A STATEMENT,

00:02:12.843 --> 00:02:17.981
THAT IT'S A SIGNAL, A DOG

00:02:15.813 --> 00:02:20.050
WHISTLE, SO ON, SO FORTH.

00:02:18.115 --> 00:02:22.386
I THINK THE PROSECUTION OF

00:02:20.184 --> 00:02:23.554
D'SOUZA, AND THE WAY IT WAS

00:02:22.519 --> 00:02:25.889
DONE, IS UNJUSTIFIED.

00:02:23.687 --> 00:02:29.460
I THINK THE PROSECUTION OF

00:02:26.023 --> 00:02:32.596
MARTHA STEWART WAS DUBIOUS.

00:02:29.593 --> 00:02:33.464
NOW, THE PRESIDENT COMMUTED

00:02:32.729 --> 00:02:36.066
BLAGOJEVICH'S SENTENCE.

00:02:33.597 --> 00:02:39.002
HE SERVED SIX YEARS.

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:40.671
AND THAT'S A JUDGMENT CALL.

00:02:39.136 --> 00:02:43.540
HE WAS CERTAINLY NOT PARDONED.

00:02:40.804 --> 00:02:45.509
&gt;&gt; Laura: LET'S TALK ABOUT WHAT

00:02:43.674 --> 00:02:47.110
JOHN BRENNAN HAS BEEN UP TO.

00:02:45.642 --> 00:02:47.911
HE'S NOW A COMMENTATOR ON

00:02:47.244 --> 00:02:51.949
ANOTHER XHETWORK.

00:02:48.045 --> 00:02:52.950
OF COURSE, FORMER TOP INTEL

00:02:52.082 --> 00:02:54.451
OFFICIAL, U.S. GOVERNMENT.

00:02:53.083 --> 00:02:54.952
HE HAS BEEN ON A TEAR WITH

00:02:54.585 --> 00:02:56.987
PRESIDENT TRUMP.

00:02:55.085 --> 00:02:59.089
&gt;&gt; I THINK MR. TRUMP HAS

00:02:57.120 --> 00:03:01.391
DEMONSTRATED A PARANOIA IN HIS

00:02:59.223 --> 00:03:02.159
SECURITY, AS WELL AS A REAL

00:03:01.525 --> 00:03:03.327
CONCERN ABOUT THE INVESTIGATION

00:03:02.292 --> 00:03:05.496
THAT IS UNDER WAY.

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:07.197
CERTAINLY HIS TWEETS DO NOT SEEM

00:03:05.629 --> 00:03:10.501
LIKE THEY'RE COMING FROM A

00:03:07.331 --> 00:03:10.901
PERSON OF INNOCENCE AND

00:03:10.634 --> 00:03:12.536
CONFIDENCE.

00:03:11.034 --> 00:03:14.838
&gt;&gt; MY REACTION IS, ORDINARILY,

00:03:12.669 --> 00:03:17.374
WOULD BE THAT JOHN BRENNAN WAS

00:03:14.972 --> 00:03:18.809
DIRECTOR OF THE CIA, MAYBE

00:03:17.508 --> 00:03:19.309
SHOULD BE TOLD TO STICK TO HIS

00:03:18.942 --> 00:03:21.311
DAY JOB.

00:03:19.443 --> 00:03:22.513
THE TROUBLE IS, GIVEN WHAT WE'RE

00:03:21.445 --> 00:03:23.881
FINDING OUT ABOUT THE WAY HE DID

00:03:22.646 --> 00:03:26.450
HIS DAY JOB, INCLUDING HIS

00:03:24.014 --> 00:03:28.519
PARTICIPATION IN PUTTING AN

00:03:26.583 --> 00:03:29.720
INFORMANT INTO THE TRUMP

00:03:28.652 --> 00:03:32.155
CAMPAIGN, MAYBE WE'RE BETTER OFF

00:03:29.853 --> 00:03:32.489
WITH HIM AS KIND OF AN AMATEUR

00:03:32.289 --> 00:03:34.224
PUNDIT.

00:03:32.623 --> 00:03:37.761
I THINK HE MAY BE PROJECTING HIS

00:03:34.358 --> 00:03:38.629
OWN VIEWS, IF I MAY BE AN

00:03:37.895 --> 00:03:39.830
AMATEUR PSYCHIATRIST FOR A

00:03:38.762 --> 00:03:40.564
MOMENT, ONTO THE PRESIDENT.

00:03:39.963 --> 00:03:43.734
BECAUSE HE IS GOING TO HAVE A

00:03:40.697 --> 00:03:45.769
LOT TO ANSWER FOR.

00:03:43.867 --> 00:03:47.371
I BELIEVE WHEN THE ENTIRE STORY

00:03:45.903 --> 00:03:48.872
GETS TOLD ABOUT WHAT THE CIA WAS

00:03:47.504 --> 00:03:51.375
DOING IN CONNECTION WITH THE

00:03:49.006 --> 00:03:52.910
RUNNING OF THE INVESTIGATION,

00:03:51.508 --> 00:03:55.078
AND WHAT IT WAS DOING WITH

00:03:53.043 --> 00:03:57.514
REGARD TO WHAT HAD BEEN ITS

00:03:55.212 --> 00:03:59.883
INFORMANT, AND HIS BEING PUT

00:03:57.648 --> 00:04:03.554
INTO THE TRUMP CAMPAIGN.

00:04:00.017 --> 00:04:05.188
&gt;&gt; Laura: WE TALKED ABOUT -- A

00:04:03.687 --> 00:04:05.856
LITTLE ABOUT THIS ON RADIO THIS

00:04:05.322 --> 00:04:06.990
MORNING, JUDGE.

00:04:05.989 --> 00:04:09.660
YOU ASKED THIS QUESTION WHICH IS

00:04:07.124 --> 00:04:11.762
WHY YOU'RE SO SMART, WHO PAID

00:04:09.793 --> 00:04:14.731
THIS INFORM MAPT, WAS HE JUST

00:04:11.895 --> 00:04:16.733
DOING THIS PRO BONO, THE WORK

00:04:14.865 --> 00:04:18.468
FOR THE CLINTON CAMPAIGN?

00:04:16.867 --> 00:04:20.137
OR FOR THE U.S. GOVERNMENT?

00:04:18.602 --> 00:04:24.074
WHO PAID?

00:04:20.270 --> 00:04:26.977
&gt;&gt; UNDERSTAND, HIS HISTORY WAS

00:04:24.207 --> 00:04:28.679
AS A CIA ASSET.

00:04:27.110 --> 00:04:31.281
BEING PUT INTO AN FBI

00:04:28.812 --> 00:04:33.684
INVESTIGATION IS VERY ODD.

00:04:31.415 --> 00:04:34.885
UNDERSTAND, THESE TWO AGENCIES,

00:04:33.817 --> 00:04:37.988
NUMBERS ONE, DON'T SHARE THEIR

00:04:35.018 --> 00:04:39.289
TOYS VERY WELL.

00:04:38.121 --> 00:04:40.824
AND AREN'T SUPPOSED TO.

00:04:39.423 --> 00:04:43.226
THE CIA IS SUPPOSED TO OPERATE

00:04:40.958 --> 00:04:44.661
IN AN OUTWARD LOOKING, FOREIGN

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:46.163
DIRECTED FASHION.

00:04:44.795 --> 00:04:47.397
THEY'RE NOT SUPPOSED TO BE DOING

00:04:46.296 --> 00:04:49.299
ANYTHING IN THE UNITED STATES.

00:04:47.531 --> 00:04:49.600
THERE'S A STATUTE THAT RESTRICTS

00:04:49.433 --> 00:04:51.068
THAT.

00:04:49.733 --> 00:04:52.135
THE FBI CONDUCTS INTELLIGENCE

00:04:51.201 --> 00:04:52.469
INVESTIGATIONS IN THE UNITED

00:04:52.269 --> 00:04:56.106
STATES.

00:04:52.603 --> 00:04:56.974
AND FOR HIM TO BE PUT INTO

00:04:56.239 --> 00:04:59.076
ESSENTIALLY AN FBI

00:04:57.107 --> 00:05:00.510
INVESTIGATION, I KIND OF WOULD

00:04:59.209 --> 00:05:01.511
LIKE TO KNOW HOW THAT HAPPENED,

00:05:00.644 --> 00:05:06.850
WHO COORDINATED IT, WHO PAID

00:05:01.645 --> 00:05:08.485
HIM, AND HOW THAT WAS ARRANGED.

00:05:06.984 --> 00:05:10.087
&gt;&gt; Laura: BARBARA McQUAID IS A

00:05:08.619 --> 00:05:11.021
FORMER U.S. ATTORNEY APPOINTED

00:05:10.220 --> 00:05:13.991
BY BARACK OBAMA, AND SHE SAID

00:05:11.154 --> 00:05:15.892
THE FOLLOWING TODAY.

00:05:14.124 --> 00:05:17.260
&gt;&gt; I THINK TODAY'S NEWS ABOUT

00:05:16.026 --> 00:05:19.296
MICHAEL COHEN REALLY SHOWS YOU

00:05:17.394 --> 00:05:19.630
WHAT HE EXPECTS IN AN ATTORNEY

00:05:19.429 --> 00:05:20.931
GENERAL.

00:05:19.763 --> 00:05:23.233
HIS EXPERIENCE WITH A LAWYER IS

00:05:21.064 --> 00:05:24.468
SOMEONE LIKE MICHAEL COHEN, A

00:05:23.367 --> 00:05:25.936
PIT BULL, SOMEONE WHO WILL

00:05:24.601 --> 00:05:28.372
PROTECT HIM, SOMEONE WHO WILL BE

00:05:26.069 --> 00:05:29.806
VERY AGGRESSIVE IN DEFENDING HIS

00:05:28.505 --> 00:05:31.141
INTERESTS, NO MATTER WHAT.

00:05:29.940 --> 00:05:32.743
BEING LOYAL TO PRESIDENT TRUMP,

00:05:31.274 --> 00:05:33.076
AS OPPOSED TO LOYAL TO THE

00:05:32.876 --> 00:05:35.145
MISSION.

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:35.846
AND IF THAT IS HIS MOTIVATION,

00:05:35.278 --> 00:05:38.582
THAT IS A CRIME.

00:05:35.979 --> 00:05:40.484
&gt;&gt; FOR HER TO COMMENT ON WHAT

00:05:38.715 --> 00:05:41.618
PRESIDENT TRUMP'S EXPECTATIONS

00:05:40.617 --> 00:05:42.586
ARE AND HIS ATTORNEY GENERAL

00:05:41.752 --> 00:05:43.954
WHEN THE ATTORNEY GENERAL WHO

00:05:42.719 --> 00:05:45.055
SERVED IN THE OBAMA

00:05:44.087 --> 00:05:47.524
ADMINISTRATION, ERIC HOLDER,

00:05:45.188 --> 00:05:48.291
REFERRED TO HIMSELF AS THE

00:05:47.658 --> 00:05:50.594
PRESIDENT'S WINGMAN, STRIKES ME

00:05:48.425 --> 00:05:51.228
AS PRETTY RICH.

00:05:50.727 --> 00:05:53.030
&gt;&gt; Laura: YEAH, YOU WERE

00:05:51.361 --> 00:05:55.565
ATTORNEY GENERAL.

00:05:53.163 --> 00:05:57.367
TALK ABOUT THE RELATIONSHIP

00:05:55.699 --> 00:05:57.968
BETWEEN A PRESIDENT AND THE

00:05:57.501 --> 00:05:59.603
ATTORNEY GENERAL.

00:05:58.101 --> 00:06:02.272
PEOPLE ARE MAKING THIS OUT TO BE

00:05:59.736 --> 00:06:04.041
SUCH A CRIME, THAT PRESIDENT

00:06:02.406 --> 00:06:06.777
TRUMP WANTED AN ATTORNEY GENERAL

00:06:04.174 --> 00:06:10.080
WHOSE FIRST INSTINCT IT WAS NOT

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:10.981
TO RECUSE HIMSELF.

00:06:10.213 --> 00:06:12.683
THE RECUSAL ISSUE IS SOMETHING

00:06:11.114 --> 00:06:13.750
WE'VE TALKED ABOUT BEFORE.

00:06:12.816 --> 00:06:14.518
BUT THAT HAS STUCK IN THE

00:06:13.884 --> 00:06:16.086
PRESIDENT'S CRAW.

00:06:14.651 --> 00:06:18.555
IF I WAS THE PRESIDENT, I WOULD

00:06:16.219 --> 00:06:19.790
NOT BE TWEETING, I WISH I HADN'T

00:06:18.689 --> 00:06:21.024
SELECTED JEFF SESSIONS.

00:06:19.923 --> 00:06:21.558
I DON'T KNOW WHAT HE THINKS THAT

00:06:21.158 --> 00:06:23.360
GETS HIM.

00:06:21.692 --> 00:06:24.695
I DON'T THINK THAT'S

00:06:23.493 --> 00:06:25.429
PARTICULARLY WISE TO DO.

00:06:24.828 --> 00:06:28.932
BUT NEVERTHELESS, THAT'S HOW HE

00:06:25.562 --> 00:06:30.967
FEELS.

00:06:29.066 --> 00:06:32.002
HE THOUGHT, WHY AM I APPOINTING

00:06:31.101 --> 00:06:35.038
YOU ATTORNEY GENERAL, IF THE

00:06:32.135 --> 00:06:35.405
FIRST THING YOU DO IS RECUSE

00:06:35.172 --> 00:06:36.473
YOURSELF.

00:06:35.539 --> 00:06:38.375
&gt;&gt; WELL, THE CIRCUMSTANCES KIND

00:06:36.606 --> 00:06:40.110
OF CAUGHT UP WITH JEFF SESSIONS,

00:06:38.508 --> 00:06:41.778
AND WITH THE PRESIDENT.

00:06:40.243 --> 00:06:44.581
AND AT THE TIME THAT JEFF

00:06:41.912 --> 00:06:45.882
SESSIONS RECUSED HIMSELF, IT MAY

00:06:44.715 --> 00:06:47.417
BE THAT HE TECHNICALLY DIDN'T

00:06:46.016 --> 00:06:49.219
HAVE TO, BECAUSE THE

00:06:47.551 --> 00:06:49.820
INVESTIGATION AT THAT POINT WAS

00:06:49.352 --> 00:06:51.321
A FOREIGN INTELLIGENCE

00:06:49.953 --> 00:06:52.522
INVESTIGATION, NOT A CRIMINAL

00:06:51.455 --> 00:06:54.091
INVESTIGATION.

00:06:52.656 --> 00:06:54.991
BUT THEN DUE IN LARGE MEASURE

00:06:54.224 --> 00:06:56.993
THE THINGS THAT THE PRESIDENT

00:06:55.125 --> 00:06:57.627
SAID AND DID, IT BECAME A

00:06:57.127 --> 00:07:00.664
CRIMINAL INVESTIGATION.

00:06:57.761 --> 00:07:02.132
AND AT THAT POINT, REGULATIONS

00:07:00.797 --> 00:07:03.533
REQUIRED THAT JEFF SESSIONS

00:07:02.265 --> 00:07:05.168
RECUSE HIMSELF.

00:07:03.667 --> 00:07:06.703
FOR THE PRESIDENT TO SUGGEST

00:07:05.302 --> 00:07:09.639
SOMEHOW JEFF SESSIONS SHOULD

00:07:06.837 --> 00:07:10.974
HAVE HAD THE GIFT OF PROPHECY

00:07:09.773 --> 00:07:12.642
AND THE SITUATION WOULD DEVELOP

00:07:11.108 --> 00:07:14.077
THAT WAY WAS RIDICULOUS, AND FOR

00:07:12.776 --> 00:07:17.981
HIM TO START CLAIMING HE SHOULD

00:07:14.211 --> 00:07:18.281
HAVE APPOINTED SOMEBODY ELSE IS

00:07:18.115 --> 00:07:20.016
INANE.

00:07:18.415 --> 00:07:21.151
IT DOESN'T, AS YOU POINT OUT, IT

00:07:20.150 --> 00:07:23.220
DOESN'T SERVE HIS INTEREST,

00:07:21.284 --> 00:07:25.322
PARTICULARLY WHEN HE'S GOT AN AG

00:07:23.353 --> 00:07:27.190
IN PLACE IN A PERSON IN JEFF

00:07:25.455 --> 00:07:29.526
SESSIONS WHO IS PURSUING HIS

00:07:27.324 --> 00:07:33.163
AGENDA, AND VERY EFFECTIVELY,

00:07:29.659 --> 00:07:36.233
BRINGING IN M-13 CASES,

00:07:33.296 --> 00:07:37.367
CONCLUDING A HUGE ANTITRUST

00:07:36.366 --> 00:07:38.268
SETTLEMENT, EFFECTIVELY RUNNING

00:07:37.501 --> 00:07:40.036
THE JUSTICE DEPARTMENT.

